# CONFLUENCIAS
# Six parts / 4:00 plus effect tails / 3-10 principal voices / seed 3181.
# Play once. Pieces turns LOOP off when loaded.
# A shared 110 : 165 : 220 cell survives every transformation.
# I  00:00 Umbral           - a common breath acquires edges.
# II 00:40 Desdoblamiento   - the same breath branches and changes skin.
# III01:20 Gravedad         - attraction, restraint and pulse pressure.
# IV 02:00 Caida            - a descent that cannot find its floor.
# V  02:40 Garganta         - the room feeds itself; ten voices meet.
# VI 03:20 Memoria          - the branches remember one pitch.
# The final L rewrite splits three paired states into six sequential parts.
# Named expressions scope their growth controls; no state leaks between parts.
!vc

